, and <a href=\"/page/Universal_Spell_Power\" title=\"Universal Spell Power\">Universal Spell Power</a>.<br />(<i>This is a rare enchantment that does not show up on all drops of this item.</i>)</span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC; vertical-align: middle;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Nightmare,_the_Fallen_Moon.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Nightmare%2C_the_Fallen_Moon.png/420px-Nightmare%2C_the_Fallen_Moon.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"688\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Nightmare%2C_the_Fallen_Moon.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">\n<p><a href=\"/page/Attuned_to_Heroism\" title=\"Attuned to Heroism\">Attuned to Heroism</a>\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\"><i>A moonblade is an elven artifact, passed down a family lineage from parent to child. Only a worthy heir to their house is able to wield a moonblade. This blade, however, has fallen far from its origin. Having been corrupted by dark magic, Nightmare will serve anyone strong enough to claim it... for a time.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817223129\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.101 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.141 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 5205/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 48260/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 15350/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 31/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion d